  "description": "Kang Sung-Tae, commissioned as a cadet officer, is unexpectedly transferred to a unit where his senior officer deserts. Because of this, his superiors begin to harass and suspect him from the very day he transfers. Stigmatized as a decommissioned officer, how will Second Lieutenant Kang Sung-Tae navigate this situation?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
